{"kind":"commit","url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/ebedd26eefe2ff4bbf5a358907c4e8e4b0d62eae","repo":"FFmpeg/FFmpeg","sha":"ebedd26eefe2ff4bbf5a358907c4e8e4b0d62eae","set":"baseline","message":"libavcodec/mips: Fix specification of instruction name\n\n1.'xor,or,and' to 'pxor,por,pand'. In the case of operating FPR,\n  gcc supports both of them, clang only supports the second type.\n2.'dsrl,srl' to 'ssrld,ssrlw'. In the case of operating FPR, gcc\n  supports both of them, clang only supports the second type.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jin Bo <jinbo@loongson.cn>\nReviewed-by: yinshiyou-hf@loongson.cn\nSigned-off-by: Michael Niedermayer <michael@niedermayer.cc>","files":[{"path":"libavcodec/mips/blockdsp_mmi.c","additions":4,"deletions":4},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/h264chroma_mmi.c","additions":10,"deletions":10},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/h264dsp_mmi.c","additions":144,"deletions":144},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/h264pred_mmi.c","additions":9,"deletions":9},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/h264qpel_mmi.c","additions":13,"deletions":13},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/hevcdsp_mmi.c","additions":16,"deletions":16},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/hpeldsp_mmi.c","additions":13,"deletions":13},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/idctdsp_mmi.c","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/mpegvideo_mmi.c","additions":47,"deletions":47},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/pixblockdsp_mmi.c","additions":4,"deletions":4},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/simple_idct_mmi.c","additions":7,"deletions":7},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/vc1dsp_mmi.c","additions":17,"deletions":17},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/vp3dsp_idct_mmi.c","additions":66,"deletions":66},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/vp8dsp_mmi.c","additions":40,"deletions":40},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/vp9_mc_mmi.c","additions":5,"deletions":5},{"path":"libavcodec/mips/wmv2dsp_mmi.c","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"additions":397,"deletions":397}